		<string text=""/>
		<string text="How sharp the shadows of characters, vehicles and weapons are. Xbox is the original's soft, blocky shadow; each step up is crisper, and costs a little more of the graphics card."/>
		<string text="Lights characters and weapons smoothly, without the flat facets of the Xbox's lighting, at a small cost."/>
		<string text="Enhanced: plasma bolts, muzzle flashes and blasts light their surroundings smoothly, with a glow. Classic lights them as the Xbox did.|Classic for everyone in a Pro 2v2 game; yours again after it."/>
